{'symbol': 'CB', 'date': '2022-10-13 09:00:00', 'title': 'COMBINED INSURANCE MARKS 100TH ANNIVERSARY WITH BRAND REFRESH', 'text': "CELEBRATION INCLUDES CHICAGO MAYORAL PROCLAMATION OF COMBINED INSURANCE DAY CHICAGO , OCT. 13, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0COMBINED INSURANCE COMPANY OF AMERICA, A CHUBB\xa0COMPANY AND A LEADING NORTH AMERICAN PROVIDER OF SUPPLEMENTAL INSURANCE SOLD TO EMPLOYEES AT THE WORKSITE AND DIRECTLY TO INDIVIDUALS, IS LAUNCHING A NEW CORPORATE IDENTITY THAT CAPTURES THE COMPANY'S ENDURING LEGACY WHILE POSITIONING ITS FUTURE WITH A MODERN UPDATE. THE ANNOUNCEMENT COMES AT AN EXCITING TIME, AS THE CITY OF CHICAGO MARKS THE COMPANY'S 100TH ANNIVERSARY WITH A PROCLAMATION OF COMBINED INSURANCE DAY ON NOV. 13."}